Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这让我想到一个概念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是cultural
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}entropy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}文化熵增
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}热力学第二定律说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}封闭系统里面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}熵只会增加
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就是混乱度只会上升
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}文化也是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}当复制的成本趋近于零的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}原创就被稀释了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}一个好的idea出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}瞬间被一千个模仿者淹没
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但你说的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}人性解决人性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个我觉得特别有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为人类历史上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}每一次技术革命都伴随着一段混乱期
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}印刷术出来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}教会说这是魔鬼的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后我们发展出了版权法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}出版伦理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}学术规范
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这些都是人性的解决方案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不是技术的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}代价是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我觉得代价可能是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是一整代人的注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是深度思考的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.06,0:00:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}是那种愿意花两个小时看一部电影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}而不是五分钟看解说的耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这个东西一旦失去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.38,0:01:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}要花多久才能重建
